statement.p:
Use the order of operations to evaluate
\dfrac{3^{3-1}+3\abs{9-10}}{\sqrt{3+18\div3}}
            \text{.}

solution.p:
We start by identifying the innermost, highest priority operations:
 egin{aligned}
 rac{3^{3-1}+3\abs{9-10}}{\sqrt{3+18\div3}}\amp= rac{3^{
extoperation{3-1}}+3\abs{
extoperation{9-10}}}{\sqrt{3+
extoperation{18\div3}}}\
\amp= rac{3^{\highlight{2}}+3
extoperation{\abs{\highlight{-1}}}}{\sqrt{
extoperation{3+\highlight{6}}}}\
\amp= rac{
extoperation{3^2}+3(\highlight{1})}{\sqrt{\highlight{9}}}\
\amp= rac{\highlight{9}+
extoperation{3(1)}}{
extoperation{\sqrt{9}}}\
\amp= rac{
extoperation{9+\highlight{3}}}{\highlight{3}}\
\amp= rac{\highlight{12}}{3}=\highlight{4}
\end{aligned}
